            "heading": "Breathable & Soft Material",
            "description": "<p>Made with premium four-fiber blend, these heated socks women and men are soft, breathable, moisture-wicking, and extra comfortable, keeping feet dry and odor-free all day. Elastic cuffs fit snugly without slipping, providing all-day comfort for various foot shapes. Ideal for heated ski socks, electric socks, and mens heated socks.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_mFja7k": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/S10_heated_socks_2.jpg",
            "heading": "Full-Foot Warmth, Total Comfort",
            "description": "<p>Engineered to heat the entire sole, these heated socks keep every step cozy and comfortable, from toes to heel. Say goodbye to cold spots—enjoy consistent warmth all day long.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_QraHdL": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/S10_heated_socks_3.jpg",
            "heading": "Elastic Cuff, Snug Fit",
            "description": "<p>Featuring a stretchable elastic cuff that hugs your foot and calf, these heated socks stay in place through every step, keeping warmth locked in and comfort constant—no slipping, no bunching, just cozy feet from dawn to dusk.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
